#: code:addons/ptplus_accounting_efatura/wizards/l10n_pt_dataport_import_efatura.py:0
msgid ""
"\n"
"%(count)s document(s) were left without a vendor bill because at least one of the taxes they report has no E-Fatura tax mapping with a product. Configure the missing mappings and run Create/Update Invoices on those documents."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"%(count)s documento(s) se quedaron sin factura de proveedor porque al menos uno de los impuestos que informan no tiene mapeo E-Fatura con producto. Configure los mapeos que faltan y ejecute Crear/Actualizar Facturas en esos documentos."

